              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                259,
                260,
                261
              ],
              "id": "2a.4"
            },
            {
              "text": "On 13 September 2025, the Provincial Dam Safety Office deployed to assess the dam and manage ongoing emergency operations.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                317,
                318,
                320
              ],
              "id": "2a.5"
            },
            {
              "text": "On 14 September 2025, phased resident returns began, Highway 6 reopened, relief aid was received in <PERSON>, and the dam operator and water authority announced operational policy changes.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
                382,
                408,
                416,
                420,
                423
              ],
              "id": "2a.6"
            },
            {
              "text": "On 15 September 2025, inter-agency coordination meetings took place in Assek Valley between the Sorrel Basin Water Authority and local emergency management.",
              "confidence": "confirmed",
              "tweet_ids": [
